# docs/adr/ is listed because the ADRs are generated from DECISIONS.md by
# scripts/gen_adrs.py. Editing a generated ADR by hand is the failure this
# pair of paths shares: the edit is real, the next regeneration silently
# discards it, and CI's --check then fails on a diff nobody made. The
# owner list is the reminder to edit the source.
